{"nodes": [{"id": "_context_plans_deployment_status_snapshot", "label": "Deployment status \u2014 snapshot stop & resume", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".context/plans/deployment-status.md", "source_location": "topo", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Go-live 100% conclu\u00eddo em 2026-06-12 (signup \u2192 WhatsApp confirma \u2192 Pix paga \u2192 Pro ativa autom\u00e1tico validado em prod). Ordem importava: merge por \u00faltimo, porque v2 sem reCAPTCHA/Resend/Asaas quebra signup e billing."}, {"id": "_context_plans_deployment_status_migration_incident", "label": "Incidente 2026-06-14: migration pendente quebrou login/signup", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".context/plans/deployment-status.md", "source_location": "INCIDENTE 2026-06-14", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A migration foi deployada no c\u00f3digo mas n\u00e3o aplicada no banco (o build era s\u00f3 next build). O Prisma Client fazia findUnique em User SEM select nos 2 caminhos select-all (authorize e register-exists-check) e selecionava a coluna inexistente. Ficou invis\u00edvel ~1 dia porque sess\u00f5es JWT antigas usam select:{id} e o catch do register engolia o erro sem reportar."}, {"id": "_context_plans_deployment_status_vercel_build_migrate", "label": "vercel-build = prisma migrate deploy && next build", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".context/plans/deployment-status.md", "source_location": "Preven\u00e7\u00e3o aplicada", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Todo deploy aplica pendentes e migration que falha BLOQUEIA o deploy (fail-safe); o build local segue next build (DB-free). captureError no catch do register para 500 de signup alertar no Sentry."}, {"id": "_context_plans_deployment_status_direct_url", "label": "DIRECT_URL (conex\u00e3o direta Neon para DDL)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".context/plans/deployment-status.md", "source_location": "Preven\u00e7\u00e3o aplicada", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "prisma.config.ts usa DIRECT_URL ?? DATABASE_URL porque DDL no Neon precisa de conex\u00e3o direta (sem pgbouncer); o runtime usa a URL pooled. Sem a var o auto-migrate cai na pooled e o DDL pode falhar."}, {"id": "_context_plans_deployment_status_prod_resources", "label": "Recursos de produ\u00e7\u00e3o (Vercel/Neon/Asaas/Resend/Cloudflare)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".context/plans/deployment-status.md", "source_location": "Recursos de produ\u00e7\u00e3o", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Dom\u00ednio clinicaorganizada.com; Vercel projeto saas1 (Hobby) com 16/16 envs; Neon com host -pooler no runtime; Asaas produ\u00e7\u00e3o com webhook por token; Resend com DKIM/SPF/DMARC verificado (remetente noreply@clinicaorganizada.com, display name ainda dizia 'ConfirmaA\u00ed' = diverg\u00eancia de marca)."}, {"id": "_context_plans_deployment_status_evolution_vps", "label": "Evolution API na VPS Hetzner + Caddy + crontab", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".context/plans/deployment-status.md", "source_location": "Funcionando em produ\u00e7\u00e3o", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Evolution v2.3.7 + Postgres 16 + Redis via Docker atr\u00e1s de Caddy com HTTPS em evolution.clinicaorganizada.com; hardening UFW/fail2ban/sshd key-only. O crontab root (*/30) chamando /api/cron/run resolve a cad\u00eancia que o Vercel Hobby n\u00e3o d\u00e1. Lat\u00eancia Nuremberg\u2194Brasil (~200ms) \u00e9 irrelevante porque o caminho lento \u00e9 WhatsApp\u2194celular."}, {"id": "_context_plans_deployment_status_cpf_hash_pepper_immutable", "label": "CPF_HASH_PEPPER de produ\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 imut\u00e1vel", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".context/plans/deployment-status.md", "source_location": "Pend\u00eancias do go-live v2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Rotacionar exigiria rehash da base toda; o valor est\u00e1 na Vercel e n\u00e3o deve ser regenerado."}], "edges": [{"source": "_context_plans_deployment_status_snapshot", "target": "_context_plans_deployment_status_migration_incident", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".context/plans/deployment-status.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_context_plans_deployment_status_migration_incident", "target": "_context_plans_deployment_status_vercel_build_migrate", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".context/plans/deployment-status.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_context_plans_deployment_status_vercel_build_migrate", "target": "_context_plans_deployment_status_direct_url", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".context/plans/deployment-status.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_context_plans_deployment_status_snapshot", "target": "_context_plans_deployment_status_prod_resources", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".context/plans/deployment-status.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_context_plans_deployment_status_snapshot", "target": "_context_plans_deployment_status_evolution_vps", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".context/plans/deployment-status.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_context_plans_deployment_status_snapshot", "target": "_context_plans_deployment_status_cpf_hash_pepper_immutable", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".context/plans/deploymen